{"id":"nervioso","lemma":"nervioso","pos":"adj","rank":1042,"glosses":["nerve","nervous, on edge","furious, annoyed, irritated"],"ipa":"/neɾˈbjoso/","forms":{"feminine":"nerviosa","masculinePlural":"nerviosos","femininePlural":"nerviosas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-nervioso.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo me puse nervioso.","en":"I got nervous.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440293"},{"text":"Tom finalmente sufrió una crisis nerviosa.","en":"Tom finally snapped.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800334"},{"text":"Todos parecen estar nerviosos.","en":"Everyone seems to be nervous.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333208"},{"text":"Ellas se pusieron nerviosas.","en":"They became nervous.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524876"},{"text":"Yo también estoy nervioso.","en":"I'm nervous, too.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442793"}]}